=== Text #1 ===
> [Dep]ortivo is finally responding the questions regarding the[ pole]mic[ case] with Vecindario[;] the lawyers of the club[ aren]’t[ only] saying that the suspension of Oltra’s license is[ unfair], but also accused the RFEF of[ been] attacking Depor.
Deportivo is now open to[ negotiate] with UD Vecindario in[ order] to solve once and for all the conflict with the Canarian club. Vecindario is asking for €700,000[ as] part of a pole[mic collaboration deal] that was cancelled on the past year.
The conflict between Deportivo and Vecindario is now threatening Deportivo. A debt of[ €]100,000 with Vecindario has turned into a loss of €700,000. For this conflict Oltra[ wasn]’[t on the] bench for the Copa clash.
